    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d305">

                <pb facs="0526" n="402" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg402"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">438.00/229: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The High Commissioner in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-04-03T13:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 3, 1923—1
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 2:43 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>47. Department is informed that the opinion of Judge Strong, legal adviser, in
                    which I concur, is that jurisdiction of Claims Commission <pb facs="0527"
                        n="403" xml:id="pg403"/> is limited to pecuniary claims pending on the date
                    of the exchange of the ratifications of the treaty, May 3, 1916.<anchor n="24"
                        xml:id="d305-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
